#. module: theme_bistro
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_bistro.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "主題"

msgid ""
"\" A perfect spot for great food. <br/>Cozy atmosphere, excellent service, "
"and delicious meals. \""
msgstr "「品嚐佳餚的絕佳地點。<br/>氣氛舒適，服務優質，餐點美味。」"

msgid ""
"\" Exceptional flavors and service! <br/>They made every dining experience "
"unforgettable. \""
msgstr "「非凡的味道及服務！<br/>他們讓每一次用餐體驗，都令人難忘。」"

msgid ""
"\" Their dishes are a delight. Fresh, flavorful, and beautifully presented. "
"\""
msgstr "「菜式令人賞心悅目。新鮮、美味，賣相精美。」"

msgid ""
"<br/>Indulge in a dining experience where flavor meets comfort. At our "
"bistro, we blend fresh ingredients with culinary creativity to offer a menu "
"that delights every palate. Whether you're here for a quick bite or a "
"leisurely meal, our welcoming atmosphere and delicious dishes make every "
"visit special.<br/><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>盡情享受美味與舒適的用餐體驗。我們的小酒館將新鮮食材與烹飪創意融為一體，"
"菜式能讓不同口味的客人開懷大嚼。無論你是要匆匆吃點快餐，還是想悠閒地享用一頓"
"飯，我們的溫馨氛圍及美味菜餚，都會讓你每次光臨變成特別回憶。<br/><br/>"

msgid ""
"<br/>Showcase your bistro’s menu online with a user-friendly platform that "
"simplifies all the steps, from setup to menu management, making it easy for "
"guests to explore and enjoy your offerings.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>使用操作簡便的平台，在網上展示你的小酒館餐牌。平台簡化所有操作，包括由初"
"始設置到菜單管理的所有步驟，使客人能夠輕鬆探索及享用你的產品。<br/>"

msgid ""
"<br/>Where every meal is a celebration of flavor and ambiance.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "<br/>每一餐，都是一場慶祝美味與氣氛的盛宴。<br/><br/>"

msgid "A Culinary Journey Awaits You"
msgstr "一場美食之旅，正等着你"

msgid ""
"A healthy kitchen with local products. We’re constantly looking to propose "
"new products and receipts. <b>While respecting seasons' products and nature."
"</b>"
msgstr ""
"健康的入廚之道是採用當地產品。我們不斷尋找新產品及貨源，<b>同時尊重自然規律及"
"季節當造產品。</b>"

msgid ""
"At the Bistro, you can expect a healthy kitchen on a daily basis. <br/>Come "
"and visit us for a Sunday brunch, healthy juices full of nutrition, or "
"delicious cakes that satisfy your sweet tooth. <b>And each day, you’ll "
"discover our Today’s Special.</b>"
msgstr ""
"在小酒館內，你每天都可以享受健康的美食。<br/>快來我們這裏享用星期日早午餐、營"
"養豐富的健康果汁，或滿足你對甜食渴求的美味蛋糕。<b>每天都有是日精選。</b>"

msgid "Attentive Service"
msgstr "貼心服務"

msgid "Book a table"
msgstr "訂枱"

msgid "Book now"
msgstr "立即預訂"

msgid "Breakfast"
msgstr "早餐"

msgid "Charming Culinary Escape: Your Neighborhood Bistro Delight"
msgstr "迷人美食之旅：喜嚐鄰里小酒館"

msgid "Crafted with flavors of passion"
msgstr "以滿載熱情的味道，精心炮製"

msgid "Culinary delights crafted just for you"
msgstr "專為你精心打造的餐饗美饌"

msgid "Curated Menus"
msgstr "精選菜單"

msgid "Cutting-Edge Culinary Techniques"
msgstr "尖端烹飪技術"

msgid ""
"Daily fresh products combined with our professional yet convivial service<br/"
"> to create a true gastronomic experience."
msgstr "每日新鮮產品，結合我們專業而歡欣的服務，<br/>創造真正美食體驗。"

msgid ""
"Delight in attentive and personalized service that ensures a memorable "
"dining experience from start to finish."
msgstr "由開始至完結，你都能享受照顧周到的個人化服務，確保用餐體驗愉快難忘。"

msgid "Dining experiences"
msgstr "餐饗體驗"

msgid "Dinner"
msgstr "晚餐"

msgid "Discover our<br/>large choice of dishes"
msgstr "探索我們<br/>豐富的菜式選擇"

msgid "Discover our<br/>new menu"
msgstr "發掘<br/>餐牌新菜式"

msgid "Discover your favorite dish"
msgstr "發現你的最喜愛菜式"

msgid "Elevate your dining experience with our unique recipes."
msgstr "我們採用獨特食譜，提升你的用餐體驗。"

msgid ""
"Enjoy a curated selection of unique cocktails and fine wines, expertly "
"paired to complement your meal."
msgstr "品嚐精心挑選、完美配搭餐點美食的獨特雞尾酒及上佳葡萄酒。"

msgid ""
"Enjoy tailored culinary advice with bespoke menus designed to suit your "
"taste preferences and dietary needs. Our personalized consultations ensure a "
"dining experience just for you."
msgstr ""
"我們的客製化菜單，專為滿足你的口味偏好及飲食需求而設計，旨在讓你享受貼身適切"
"的烹飪建議。我們的個人化諮詢服務，確保你能享受專屬的用餐體驗。"

msgid ""
"Enjoy tasty food with friends.<br/><small>From <b>6:30 pm</b> to <b>10:30 "
"pm</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"與好友共嚐美味佳餚。<br/><small><b>晚上 6:30</b> 至 <b>晚上 10:30</b></small>"

msgid "Enjoy the tastiest meal of your life at our place"
msgstr "親臨我們這裏，享受你人生中最美味的一餐"

msgid ""
"Enjoy thoughtfully crafted dishes that highlight seasonal ingredients and "
"local flavors, offering a unique dining experience."
msgstr "品嚐精心烹調、突出時令食材及地道風味的佳餚，享受獨特的餐饗體驗。"

msgid "Exceptional Service"
msgstr "服務優質出眾"

msgid "Exclusive Events"
msgstr "獨家活動"

msgid "Experience Culinary<br/>Excellence at Bella Bistro"
msgstr "走入 Bella Bistro<br/>體驗卓越美食"

msgid ""
"Experience culinary excellence at our bistros and cafes. Our menu is crafted "
"to delight your senses, offering a unique blend of flavors that celebrate "
"the art of dining."
msgstr ""
"走進我們的小酒館及咖啡室，體驗卓越美食。我們的菜單經過精心設計，旨在讓你大飽"
"口福，提供獨特的風味組合，細味餐飲藝術。"

msgid "Experience the Pinnacle of Fine Dining and Innovation"
msgstr "體驗精緻餐飲與創新的巔峰"

msgid ""
"Experience the latest in gastronomic innovation with advanced cooking "
"techniques. Our unique flavor combinations and modern methods elevate the "
"art of dining to new heights."
msgstr ""
"品嚐先進烹飪技術，體驗最新美食創意。我們獨特的風味組合及現代烹調方法，將餐飲"
"藝術提升至新的高度。"

msgid "Expert Chef Workshops"
msgstr "專家廚師工作坊"

msgid "Expertise and Flavor"
msgstr "專業知識與獨特風味"

msgid ""
"Explore more and find your favorite flavors crafted with passion, designed "
"to delight your palate and satisfy your cravings."
msgstr ""
"探索更多內容，找出你最喜愛的口味。食物精心製作，旨在讓你享受味蕾快感，滿足食"
"慾。"

msgid "Explore our different menus and plan your next lunch <br/><br/>"
msgstr "探索我們不同的菜單，想想下一頓午餐吃甚麼好<br/><br/>"

msgid "Get started"
msgstr "開始"

msgid "Gourmet Dining Experience"
msgstr "美食餐飲體驗"

msgid "Gourmet Dining Experiences"
msgstr "美饌餐饗體驗"

msgid ""
"Help you start your morning right.<br/><small>From <b>7:30 am</b> to "
"<b>10:30 am</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"為你展開美妙的新一天。<br/><small><b>早上 7:30</b> 至 <b>早上 10:30</b></"
"small>"

msgid "Indulge in Culinary Excellence at Our Bistros"
msgstr "在我們的小酒館，盡情享用出色烹調"

msgid ""
"Indulge in fresh, flavorful dishes with our menu that brings a taste of "
"comfort and gourmet excellence, every time."
msgstr "我們的菜單，讓你每次都能品嚐新鮮可口的菜餚，享受舒適體驗及卓越美食。"

msgid ""
"Join hands-on workshops led by renowned chefs. Learn advanced cooking skills "
"and insider tips to refine your culinary expertise and bring new flavors to "
"your kitchen."
msgstr ""
"參加名廚主持的實踐工作坊。學習進階烹飪技巧及秘技，提高你的烹飪專業知識，為你"
"的廚房引入新風味。"

msgid "Lunch"
msgstr "午餐"

msgid "Our Menu"
msgstr "我們的菜單"

msgid "Our Newest Culinary Delights"
msgstr "我們的最新美食"

msgid ""
"Our team is here to provide warm, personalized service, ensuring that every "
"visit is comfortable and memorable."
msgstr "我們的團隊隨時為你提供熱情、個人化的服務，確保你每次光臨都舒適難忘。"

msgid "Personalized Culinary Consultations"
msgstr "個人化烹飪諮詢"

msgid "Personalized Dining"
msgstr "個人化餐飲體驗"

msgid "Present your<br/>menus.Easily."
msgstr "展示餐牌<br/>輕而易舉"

msgid "Quality and Freshness"
msgstr "卓越品質及新鮮度"

msgid "Reserve Your Table"
msgstr "訂枱"

msgid "Reserve your table today."
msgstr "立即訂座！"

msgid ""
"Savor exquisite culinary creations crafted by top chefs. Our gourmet dining "
"experiences feature innovative dishes and premium ingredients, promising an "
"unforgettable meal."
msgstr ""
"品嚐頂級廚師精心烹調的精緻美食。我們的餐饗體驗，以創新菜式及優質食材為特色，"
"保證為你奉上難忘一餐。"

msgid ""
"Savor exquisite dishes crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients in a "
"sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere."
msgstr "沉浸於精緻而溫馨的氣氛，細味以優質新鮮食材炮製的精美佳餚。"

msgid ""
"Savor our delectable dishes and enjoy a cozy atmosphere perfect for any "
"occasion. Our menu features a blend of classic favorites and innovative "
"creations, all crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients."
msgstr ""
"品嚐我們的美味佳餚，享受適合任何場合的溫馨氣氛。我們的菜單融合經典菜式及創新"
"料理，全部採用新鮮優質食材炮製。"

msgid "Savor our latest menu items crafted for a memorable dining experience."
msgstr "品嚐我們精心設計的最新菜單，享受難忘餐饗體驗。"

msgid "Savor the art<br/>of casual dining"
msgstr "細味休閒餐飲的<br/>藝術"

msgid ""
"Savor the finest cuisine at our bistros and cafes, where each dish is "
"crafted with passion and precision. Whether it’s a casual meal or a special "
"occasion, we have something for everyone."
msgstr ""
"在我們的小酒館及咖啡室，你會品嚐到最精緻美味的佳餚，每一道菜都以熱情加上精確"
"配方，用心製作。無論是休閒便餐，還是特別場合，我們都能滿足不同需求。"

msgid ""
"Savor the finest culinary delights at our bistro, where exceptional food "
"meets an unforgettable dining experience."
msgstr "歡迎光臨我們的小酒館，品嚐最精緻佳餚，享受非凡美饌及難忘餐饗體驗。"

msgid "Savor the flavor: a culinary experience awaits"
msgstr "細嚐美味：美食體驗等着你"

msgid "Savor the flavors of our bistro"
msgstr "品嚐我們小酒館的美味"

msgid "Seasonal<br/> Flavors"
msgstr "時令<br/>風味"

msgid "See Today's Specials"
msgstr "看看今日精選"

msgid "Signature Cocktails and Wines"
msgstr "招牌雞尾酒、葡萄酒"

msgid "Sustainable Ingredients"
msgstr "可持續食材"

msgid ""
"Take a break from your busy schedule.<br/><small>From <b>11:30 am</b> to "
"<b>2:30 pm</b></small>"
msgstr ""
"忙裏偷閒，放鬆休息片刻。<br/><small><b>上午 11:30</b> 至 <b>下午 2:30</b></"
"small>"

msgid ""
"Take part in special events and tasting nights that showcase new dishes, "
"local wines, and culinary creativity."
msgstr "參加特別活動及嚐味之夜，展示新菜式、當地葡萄酒，以及創新烹飪。"

msgid ""
"Taste our chef's special, an almond macaroon with orange blossom buttercream."
msgstr "品嘗主廚特製的杏仁馬卡龍及橙花奶油蛋糕。"

msgid "Taste the Difference"
msgstr "品嚐不同之處"

msgid "Tasty Meals"
msgstr "美味餐饗"

msgid "The perfect dessert to share for the table."
msgstr "適合全桌客人分享的完美甜品。"

msgid "Today's special"
msgstr "今日精選"

msgid "View more"
msgstr "查看更多"

msgid ""
"We craft custom dishes to match your unique tastes. Our chefs work closely "
"with you to ensure a delightful dining experience from appetizer to dessert."
msgstr ""
"我們精心製作客製化菜餚，滿足你的獨特口味。我們的廚師會與你密切合作，確保從開"
"胃菜到甜品，你都能大快朵頤。"

msgid ""
"We offer innovative recipes and classic favorites. Leveraging the finest "
"ingredients, we help you savor every bite."
msgstr ""
"我們提供創新食譜及經典熱門菜式，採用最優質材料，務求讓你每一口都品嚐到精緻美"
"味。"

msgid "What we offer to our guests"
msgstr "多樣化客戶服務"

msgid ""
"With extensive experience and a passion for culinary arts, we provide dishes "
"that keep you coming back for more."
msgstr "憑藉豐富經驗及對烹飪藝術的熱情，我們提供的佳餚，會讓你流連忘返。"

msgid ""
"Your satisfaction is our priority. Our staff is always ready to assist, "
"ensuring you enjoy a smooth and memorable meal."
msgstr ""
"你稱心滿意，是我們的首要任務。我們的工作人員隨時準備好為你提供協助，確保你能"
"享受順利而難忘的用餐體驗。"

msgid "happy guests served"
msgstr "滿意顧客"
